s":["&曹植\n每当西山日落，我的思绪万千惆怅。\n没有了心中所爱的人，\n纵然锦衣驷马，又有何用？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n眼见政务荒废，却不能自拔……\n难道这……就是命运？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n哈哈……哈哈……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n你可曾听说洛水女神的传说？\n在我心中，那……多么像你……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,159,0,54,70,2]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["由于传说中的洛水之神名字叫宓妃，\n使曹植不免感伤。\n一时兴起，作《洛神赋》。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n……御着对曰：“臣闻河洛之神，名曰\n宓妃。然则君王之所见也，无乃是乎！\n其状若何？臣愿闻之。”……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n……其形也，翩若惊鸿，婉若游龙。\n荣曜秋菊，华茂春松。仿佛兮若轻云\n之蔽月，飘遥兮若流风之回雪……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n……余情悦取其美兮，心震荡而不怡。\n无良媒以接欢兮，托微波而通辞……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹植\n……含辞未吐，气若幽兰。\n华容婀娜，令我忘餐……"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[15]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,53,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,54,80,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,64,64,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,44,64,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[3,44,58,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[17,44,52,1,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":2421,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1320],[]]},"end":106,"end_off":2491},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[22,64,58,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[19,64,52,3,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":2491,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1315],[]]},"end":110,"end_off":2561},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[19,64,58,3,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[23,64,52,3,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["白色祭坛"]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["鱼腹浦  曹操军主营"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args