":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n兄长……\n我又回到白帝城了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，相信在此時此刻，\n雲長你的心情非常複雜吧？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n是的。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n我可以理解你的心情，\n但是希望你能快點振作，\n告訴我們關於白帝城的一切訊息。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n是。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":5274,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5299,"body_end":5630,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[17]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n我们在鱼腹浦得到了四神宝玉，\n不过它有什么功用呢？\n&荀彧\n貂蝉，这块宝玉正如其名，\n蕴含着四神的力量。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n据传青龙的力量就是雷电，\n朱雀的力量則是火焰。\n&荀彧\n除此以外，有了這塊寶玉還能在施展\n策略時不受天氣限制的效果，用途很廣。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n不愧是荀彧先生，真是见识广博。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":5630,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5655,"body_end":5717,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[23]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n四神寶玉該由誰來裝備呢？\n這是個問題。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":5717,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5742,"body_end":5864,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n蜀将知道孔明被魔王附体的事吗？\n&曹操\n恐怕尚不知情，\n到现在还被孔明蒙在鼓里吧！\n&关羽\n……………"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}